This project is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It includes material from QuickLogic Corporation's qorc-sdk
(https://github.com/QuickLogic-Corp/qorc-sdk), also licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0:

- firmware/qf_hello/ is based on qorc-sdk qf_apps/qf_helloworldsw. Files taken
  from the SDK keep their original QuickLogic copyright and license headers.

The Dockerfile downloads, at build time and without redistributing them:
- QuickLogic's SymbiFlow FPGA toolchain (quicklogic-fpga-toolchain)
- qorc-sdk and s3-gateware (QuickLogic Corporation)
- Arm GNU Toolchain 9-2020-q2 (Arm Limited)
- Miniconda (Anaconda, Inc.) and packages from the quicklogic-corp conda channel

flash.sh and fw_flash.sh download QuickLogic's TinyFPGA-Programmer-Application.
Each of these is covered by its own license.
